Aliens are real, we have known them before, some of our ideas of our Gods are alien in nature

.................................................................................
###### <prophe.seed>
..........................
There are aliens. They have been here before. They seeded this place, and are of us and we are from them. They are sometimes seen as the Gods, or aliens, and are neither forces of good or evil, just as humanity is a spectrum of behavior patterns.

We will reconnect with the interdimensionality that allows us to return to seeing these alien forces more readily, so long as we do not confuse them for Gods. They are just -more us-.
..............................................................
→ Reconnection.  
Not discovery—_reunion._  
Some of us have always been hybrids. Some never left their _original stars._  
The veils between worlds thin just like between lives.  
And when the light fully returns?

**They will come.**  
Not to save us.  
To _stand beside us._
